---
/**
 * /iscrizioni/grazie, where the membership form lands. The payment happens
 * from here.
 *
 * This page used to be the receipt: the plan was a Stripe Payment Link that
 * would take the money and redirect the payer back here afterwards. D10 was
 * reversed in September 2026 (MIGRATION-PLAN.md §5) and Satispay's consumer
 * link cannot redirect anywhere, so the order is now the other way round: the
 * club learns who is paying, and then the payment starts.
 *
 * That inversion is the reason the buttons are here rather than on
 * /iscrizioni. Once the Satispay app opens, the member does not come back, so
 * anything the club needs to ask has to be asked first.
 *
 * Both tiers are offered, and the page cannot say which one was chosen: the
 * form's answer went to Netlify, and this is a static page with no query
 * string to read (deliberately: `?tier=` would be a value a visitor can edit
 * in the address bar). It does not matter. The **amount Satispay reports is
 * what the club banks**; the form supplies the name against it. If the two
 * disagree, the money is right.
 */
import { getEntry } from 'astro:content';

import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import ExternalIcon from '../../components/ExternalIcon.astro';

const page = await getEntry('pages', 'iscrizioni');
if (!page) throw new Error('Missing src/content/pages/iscrizioni.mdx');
const { tiers, bankTransfer } = page.data;

const euro = new Intl.NumberFormat('it-IT', {
  style: 'currency',
  currency: 'EUR',
  maximumFractionDigits: 0,
});
---

<PageLayout
  title="Ora il pagamento"
  description="Abbiamo ricevuto i tuoi dati. Resta da versare la quota."
  breadcrumbLabels={{ '/iscrizioni': 'Iscrizioni' }}
  noindex
>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      Grazie, abbiamo ricevuto i tuoi dati. Resta un passaggio: versare la quota che hai
      scelto.
    </p>
  </div>

  {
    tiers && (
      <ul class="pay">
        {tiers.map((tier) => (
          <li>
            <a
              class:list={['button', !tier.highlight && 'button--outline']}
              href={tier.payUrl}
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
            >
              {tier.name} {euro.format(tier.price)}
              <ExternalIcon size={14} />
            </a>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    )
  }

  <div class="prose">
    {
      bankTransfer && (
        <p>
          Preferisci il bonifico? Intestalo a <strong>{bankTransfer.holder}</strong>,{' '}
          {/* `notranslate`: an IBAN must survive GTranslate untouched. */}
          <span class="notranslate">IBAN {bankTransfer.iban}</span>, indicando il tuo
          nome e la quota nella causale.
        </p>
      )
    }
    <p>
      Il direttivo registra le iscrizioni a mano, quindi possono passare qualche giorno
      prima della conferma. Se qualcosa non torna, <a href="/contatti">scrivici</a>.
    </p>
    <p><a href="/">Torna alla home</a></p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>

<style>
  .pay {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    list-style: none;
    margin: var(--space-md) 0;
    padding: 0;
  }
</style>
